"title": "Yoeli 1:1–20:1",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "29001001-29001020",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Watu wa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108480\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">ufalme wa kusini</data> walikuwa na huzuni sana. <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108199\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Mungu</data> alikuwa ametuma janga la nzige katika nchi yao.</p><p>Hii ilikuwa kama janga la nzige ambayo Mungu alituma <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108251\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Misri</data>. Hiyo ilikuwa wakati wa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108308\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">tauni kumi</data>. Katika wakati wa Yoeli, nzige waliharibu mazao yote ya ufalme wa kusini.</p><p>Joel alielezea tukio hili kama <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108571\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">siku ya Bwana</data>. Hii ilimaanisha kwamba Mungu alikuwa ameleta <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108233\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">hukumu</data> dhidi ya watu wake (<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108302\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">watu wa Mungu</data>).</p><p>Joel aliwasihi watu wa Mungu kulia, kufunga chakula na kumwita Mungu. Kuomboleza, <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108456\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">kufunga</data> na <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108227\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">kuomba</data> zilikuwa njia za kuonyesha kuwa watu waligeuka kutoka kwa <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108195\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">dhambi</data>. Vitendo hivi vilionyesha kuwa watu <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108346\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">walitubu</data> dhambi na kumrudia Mungu.</p>",
